   <chapter title="Overview">
       <p><b>File:</b> <code>OtherTests/Priority2/Client_Evaluation_test.cy.ts</code></p>
        <p><b>Folder:</b> <code>OtherTests/Priority2</code></p>
        <p><b>Description:</b> End-to-end flow that generates a provider hash key, creates a regulation group, defines a criterion and answer, adds an individual client mapped to that group, performs an evaluation via staging APIs, and tears down by deleting the regulation group.</p>
        <p><b>Priority:</b> High</p>
        <p><b>Owner:</b> QA Team</p>
        <p><b>Tags:</b> regression, smoke, e2e, staging-api, regulation-groups, criteria, individual-clients, evaluations</p>
        <p><b>Dependencies:</b> user-authentication, faker-js, cypress, env-api_baseUrl</p>
    </chapter>

